RDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"586\" bgcolor=\"#3366ff\" height=\"11\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 2pt double; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 2pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 2pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 2pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"635\" height=\"215\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">구미교육지원청과 우리대학교가 학습지원 협약을 체결하여 구미 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">관내 중학생을 대상으로 야간 학습 지원을 위한 강사 학생을 다음과</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"> 같이 모집하니 많이 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;- 지도학생 : 중학교 1, 2학년&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">지도시기 : 2011.11.2(수)부터</span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;- 지도과목 : 영어, 수학</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">- 지도시간 : 야간(18:00~)</span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">교육장소 : 구미시 신평동 신기초등학교[위 센터(Wee Center)]</span></font></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 모집인원 : 4명</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2. 지원자격</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2학년 이상의 재학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 올바른 인성이 함양되고 성적이 우수하며 봉사정신이 있는 학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 유 경험 학생 우대</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">3. 신청기간 : 2011.10.6.(목)~10.11(화)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">4. 제출서류 : 신청서<font size=\"5\">[서식1]</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">5. 제출장소 : 학생처(본관 101호)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">6. 지원자 면접 : 개별 통보</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">7. 지원학생 특전</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 지도비 : 시간당 15,000원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 자원봉사시간 인정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 삼성전자 취업 시 인센티브 제공</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">붙임&nbsp; 1. 청소년 공부방 운영 계획서 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 신청서<font size=\"5\">[서식1]</font> 1부.&nbsp; 끝.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-B